  "bodyHash": "3076d5e4d6dc7e12",
  "content": "<p>Snekcraft 添加了球蟒、玉米蛇和西部猪鼻蛇，并拥有多种可通过繁殖获得的颜色和图案变体。成为蛇类繁育者，利用你对蛇遗传学的知识来培育出最漂亮的蛇吧！它们目前还不会做什么特别的事，但绝对非常可爱 :)</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yryoy6P.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"596\" height=\"228\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">有问题？欢迎加入我们的&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13)\" href=\"https://discord.gg/xD9vapaSRd\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>猪鼻蛇：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>图案：</strong></p>\n<p>普通</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_de552ac9-e429-4f78-9a01-7a5c099d1487.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>康达（Conda）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_cdd9baaf-0225-4282-8d63-0a12d3b77d3e.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>超级康达（Superconda）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_de0d655b-5e79-476d-8df4-2e473f0f9335.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>颜色：</strong></p>\n<p>普通</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_f641abc7-9d4f-42db-8767-ae6d2162fa9a.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>白化</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_20fbd57c-4310-495b-8166-211f6f13f15f.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>无黄质（Axanthic）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_92f803bb-9298-4226-87ed-d87e4101a7f0.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>北极</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_f649ba91-bdb8-4129-9e0a-b5daaf680fae.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>超级北极</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_d645b195-018d-4f58-bb9d-4a84fa25b439.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>白化北极</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_c6d576d6-69a4-42f9-92a3-83abbc3ce8bd.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>无黄质北极</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_17c63347-8c59-4d5b-91ba-5c1546afa0b7.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>无黄质超级北极</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>零度以下（Subzero）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_2bb61b43-9a95-4069-85ed-ec6379fb7cb4.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>雪</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_2a407eb9-2dde-4673-a24c-360b13780beb.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>雪怪</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_b483a91d-32ee-43cf-b38d-dca5a33cfc36.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>彩虹</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_4c9fb2c3-a6c2-43b4-94e7-83c255de9b4a.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>球蟒：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>颜色（普通、Piebald、Pinstripe）：</strong></p>\n<p>普通</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_3f30b4a9-ec81-432a-9a4f-20668d3cf0be.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"352\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_7b17a958-de6f-405e-a37f-a2982409afbc.png\" width=\"502\" height=\"393\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_0950e68b-839e-4db4-84bb-46ba595ff676.png\" width=\"502\" height=\"414\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>火（Fire）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_de4de966-bc9e-4e43-ba86-e82e534e6f62.png\" width=\"483\" height=\"389\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_187cc495-7bab-4198-abc8-495d7ee2afa1.png\" width=\"484\" height=\"393\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_4b8d501b-97ef-45af-9f87-e0acef65f7f6.png\" width=\"487\" height=\"351\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>淡色（Pastel）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_5c786e89-7b8e-4183-87b8-80c830cb0c0c.png\" width=\"494\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_975eeb5d-a27e-4719-8753-4f441c4c07b9.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"404\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_95326d9d-ff78-4aa5-9680-662ca7dfced3.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"431\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑淡色（Black Pastel）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_509b54ed-1ac4-46f0-a13b-e0b67c60a096.png\" width=\"495\" height=\"345\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_805d15ad-1a0f-4355-a465-a9eb23dae256.png\" width=\"499\" height=\"411\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_1cbc9028-e01f-4125-99e4-2d9a616fef08.png\" width=\"499\" height=\"448\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑眼白化（Black-Eyed Leucy）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_95fcb506-4f2c-487f-a78e-7a25d5bddc49.png\" width=\"490\" height=\"402\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>超级淡色（Super Pastel）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_9b9c17b8-341b-44a9-bfd5-3a8240b18aa2.png\" width=\"484\" height=\"395\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_90893e26-cf3a-40f6-838e-d28c0c211d41.png\" width=\"484\" height=\"371\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_f2f1c7cf-70e9-40d1-8090-afd05d2af26c.png\" width=\"485\" height=\"396\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>超级黑淡色（Super Black Pastel）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_7687f7c7-c8a9-4daf-9178-264b1ce94a33.png\" width=\"483\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_e4272338-6500-46bf-a3d1-e21a91859270.png\" width=\"482\" height=\"345\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>萤火虫（Firefly）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_452b2d2d-6d4c-4dca-8ec9-38abcef0efb6.png\" width=\"484\" height=\"441\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_b492cc76-2bf9-4ff1-9d30-f705500b3d03.png\" width=\"482\" height=\"349\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_4fc818b9-5c0d-40c3-9771-e79d8810ce04.png\" width=\"485\" height=\"346\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑火（Black Fire）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_16a3e002-5707-42be-92b4-c3afc2fd5d80.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_84d91450-1bb9-4ef6-8490-78ecf2a233e9.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"373\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_ed60574a-f95b-4f62-9e43-851da6a6884f.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"409\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑锡（Black Pewter）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_288a3f4b-9227-4824-bade-4499e17c8304.png\" width=\"546\" height=\"433\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_52fff84e-b414-4d63-af8b-767172b8d7f4.png\" width=\"545\" height=\"409\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_8fe47f02-6d46-47d1-92b8-2fad9ee42dfe.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"407\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑火淡色（Black Fire Pastel）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_51acf76b-92f0-4dcb-9a37-c235360cac67.png\" width=\"545\" height=\"413\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_65014c84-f4c8-46c9-92f3-6ab4828f6499.png\" width=\"545\" height=\"387\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_0214a31b-7a6f-4492-aa89-429175b6e0c9.png\" width=\"541\" height=\"394\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>玉米蛇</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>顏色（普通、棕櫚、雜色）：</strong></p>\n<p>普通</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_56f06d1b-cf3b-4f9c-887f-93cf0b698c5b.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_6771b413-874b-4dbf-ae25-8c48f9def847.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_481de96c-87b7-424a-abb9-a3fd1f2e08c1.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Amel</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_fb1d25d4-b371-4e60-93e5-3d462a87e5f2.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_5b698957-ec76-4eb9-8649-a75a2462842a.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_3144cc82-88f5-4d2d-8401-504fbffecb10.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Anery</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_d5e44d6d-439f-490f-b580-25806aa47b2e.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_ff291a6c-d742-4cc7-b507-186884adfd3b.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_e15ed054-bf19-43a0-9f11-3a83935dab69.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Lavender</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_89e45be4-3c6d-471c-80a8-8a90e55ac5bc.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_71a4dfe6-10cb-44f7-8d85-008c0cb6b394.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_d8d5b780-0f0f-426f-a77f-459ad6a5ebc9.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Caramel</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_b0b159a3-1d1f-4ec4-b1d5-f8e8022fb0f6.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_7dea71bb-ee73-4c24-b927-b5b725404092.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_47dcb0f7-7808-473b-8811-69fb2441065e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Snow</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_d1432f1a-afcf-4b89-8d6a-b8210690c462.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_c8104f25-49e3-45f4-b185-70f3ab7dfaf8.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_c9b732ed-d25b-4dd3-b702-90c803a9c92a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Moonstone</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_9c81a9bc-3832-4546-82bb-1aceb0bbfcf0.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_693fe87e-5afa-42e0-adc7-c1fa2d43c4ba.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_9bd66185-2261-4270-af30-f5a92b93e8e3.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Opal</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_fd0ad435-f117-4b12-ae81-eb923cfdae17.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_2796969a-6e7e-487f-aca7-16e6ffbb5fbc.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_ba82f68f-a5c7-42f6-b942-266a7004d78a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Anery Caramel</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_6951c825-a648-474a-a77c-22068324b6fb.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_6c8bf209-165e-4ae1-bff8-d252f62953f7.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_558ad067-0397-44fa-b602-75af3ea525ec.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Butter</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_f925026d-e43d-464a-bce0-918fa3fa0ae9.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_9c15d425-954c-41c1-8aad-58b7c6ff22d7.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_e4adcf30-4726-44ac-aeab-d5dfb721877c.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Almond</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_44513a17-8397-415f-b6a9-02cbf4896928.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_410ae2d7-abee-4196-8ea1-d64f2bab7879.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_6a9f234e-8b20-499b-9258-eaffa43551cf.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Lavender Butter</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_f5f29d00-89c4-42c7-be2c-e7f04b71ec2a.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_96585594-38a1-4d4d-9943-e5e511424b50.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_cab7c42c-443b-4380-8d03-03fe9ee27dcb.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Xanthic Snow</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_0f5da853-d55d-4d9d-b295-337e18065508.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Glacier</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_7f64fb83-b87a-41ab-9cac-c15dc5b0d0a3.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_a670b46d-920d-4cc2-8bbb-4045444cc6e1.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_1e1d10fb-6c1b-403d-9d6b-05ba76916730.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Moonstone Caramel</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_8cf1859d-fd5e-4ace-afa7-024de98aad60.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_7ab72d19-515e-48a3-ac4c-648f45251b14.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_6d38391f-bfc8-496f-9177-82509716809b.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Xanthic Snow Lavender</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_f96c4f5f-b525-4ab6-9cba-076351ae23a5.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_4b416d1c-3175-4250-a0e2-66c70600b37c.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Corned Snake</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/877314/description_9c2178b0-e6dc-4c70-a675-02c194c8ab3d.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>未來將會有更多蛇類物種加入！</p>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><strong>繁殖機制/遺傳學：</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>通過餵食生雞肉、生兔肉或青蛙腿來繁殖蛇，如果周圍空間足夠，它們就會產卵。蛋的孵化方式類似於龜蛋，但速度更快，不受時間限制，也不必擔心生物毀壞蛋。蛋只能在沙地或泥土上孵化，且拾起後仍會保留遺傳特性。只有在野外才能找到基本的「野生型」顏色和花紋；所有其他變種都必須通過繁殖獲得。Snekcraft 與 Rats 模組相容，所有蛇都會食用該模組提供的鼠肉。</p>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>以下是關於遺傳學工作原理的簡短說明。如果您不想深入了解，沒必要掌握詳細知識；實際上，透過實驗並自己發現什麼有效也是一大樂趣！<br><br></p>\n<p>只有野生型蛇，即「普通」蛇，會在野外生成。繁殖兩條普通蛇通常會產生更多普通蛇，但它們有小機率產生基礎基因以供您開始培育。所有基因分為顯性、不完全顯性或隱性。如果蛇擁有顯性基因，它一定會表現出來。隱性基因只有在沒有顯性基因存在時才會表現。不完全顯性基因會與顯性或隱性基因結合產生新特徵，或者在與其他不完全顯性基因結合時表現得特別明顯。為了降低複雜度，無法通過 breeding 使蛇成為某種基因的 het（即擁有一個不視覺顯示但影響繁殖的顯性基因和一個隱性基因），但在與另一條擁有基礎基因的蛇繁殖時，所有普通蛇都可以被視為對基礎基因是 het。組合並繁殖以嘗試弄清楚遊戲中的基因是什麼，以及它們各自可以組合產生什麼！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>注意：特殊品種（彩虹、微笑臉、玉米棒）是獨立的類別。只有當您能繁殖出最終的基因大雜燴時，才有（小）機率獲得其中一種！</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>豬鼻蛇生成於沙漠、平原、向日葵平原和草地。球蟒生成於平原和稀樹草原。玉米蛇生成於沼澤和叢林。可以使用蛇袋來捕捉和運輸蛇。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>還添加了不同的棲息箱來安置您的蛇（和其他生物），例如鐵絲籠、生態箱、水族箱和熔岩水族箱。使用棲息箱鑰匙可以改變任何類型棲息箱外部牆壁的實體性（持有鑰匙時，外部非實體牆壁僅會顯示輪廓）。相鄰的不同類型棲息箱之間可以互相連接。棲息箱至少需要 3x3x1 的大小才能發揮最佳效果。使用不同類型的躲避處和加熱燈讓您的蛇感到快樂！要將躲避處或任何裝飾品放置在圍欄內，請移除您希望放置裝飾品位置的圍欄方塊，放置躲避處，然後使用圍欄鑰匙關閉周圍的牆壁。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>蛇偶爾會掉落蜕皮，可用於製作蛇袋、皮革或鱗片，以及毒牙，毒牙可製成骨粉，但可能在未來的更新中變得更有用！</p>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><strong>合成配方：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>圍欄：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8c36PyZ/terrarium.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"272\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qC1CKfC/wire-cage.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"272\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6njmZ3H/aquarium.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dJXykd7/water.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>*生態箱將留在網格中。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/J2tsSQQ/lavaquarium.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNsTp5z/lava.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p>*生態箱將留在網格中。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>躲避處：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x61nmsx/dirt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xfzKdTD/oak.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MNwqNy2/spruce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/prmZWP8/birch.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p461C6h/jungle.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p205y6x/acacia.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KLvP5xb/darkoak.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2Z18ZvY/stone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDjtW9n/brick.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gPCkVcn/moss.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1fzS2KD/sand.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/QYZC3cy/lamp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cyhz087/light.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>其他：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rpxs4QZ/key.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3S39n2x/snakebag.png\" alt=\"Snake Bag\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LxT9GRy/scute.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nMF0mT1/bonemeal.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"124\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>僅在 MC 1.18.2 版本中需要 geckolib。</p>\n<p>編碼和紋理由 Raspix 負責。模型、更多紋理和動畫由 PiedPipecleaner 負責。Fabric 版本感謝 Brent 和 Snektron。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
